{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d0_level_act18d0_02_beg","groupId":"act18d0","stageId":"act18d0_02","title":"綠洲驚雷","storyCode":"WD-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1091829ab368eb9c0706008850d1a70e472a5a368a9b911e232b0c76a6cdb6f7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"2上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"十七年前\n3:09 P.M.  天氣/晴\n烏薩斯，移動城市切爾諾伯格主航道西北側一百四十七公里，村落"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村莊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快，醫生說要準備溫水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"這突然要上哪去找溫水......問問瑪莎，問問她家早上燒的水還有剩的沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝在上，求求您保佑老頭子吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾一下......這裡發生什麼事了，您說的醫生是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你......您是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"您從哪裡來......您這身打扮，是城裡來的？抱歉，抱歉，我們現在得忙著救人......您不介意的話，跟我往這走，至少能坐一坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係......我就是來找那個醫生的。她叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您不會是來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是一個可疑的醫生，你們很信任她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"可她......可只有她能救好老頭子啦，求求您，我求求您，至少現在，她只是個救人的醫生啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不是來抓她的。我只是找她有點事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能為我帶路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也算是個醫生。也許我能幫上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，看您這身打扮，馱獸也知道您的才學......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可以先告訴凱爾希醫生，告訴她，她的學生莉莉婭來探望她了，問問她需不需要幫手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原來您知道醫生的名字，您是叫莉莉婭，是嗎？好的，好的，真是個好聽的名字，您請稍等，我這就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，喂！別忘了讓瑪莎送溫水來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"咬緊牙關，堅持住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊啊——咕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凱爾希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"遭到野獸襲擊，應急處理罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，呃......在、在哪裡......我找不著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......會感染嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分感染生物都比人們想像的要乾淨，看齒痕，應該是附近遊蕩的獠獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但如果是誤觸了活性源石的獠獸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"感染生物也許有辦法和各種病菌和平共處，但是人類不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"情況很嚴重，不光是源石感染，還有壞死症狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"痛......好痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜些，深呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——喝——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼吸困難，可能是血栓。都是急性礦石病的症狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"但，但不是身上冒出石頭才是礦石病嗎！？老頭子他這不是沒事嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某些情況下，感染源會在血液裡迅速循環，不會像普通的礦石病那樣出現體表源石結晶，而是在短時間內迅速加劇感染症狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不靠藥物抑制......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝在上，皇帝在上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你學得很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"注射器，在那個灰色的藥箱裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給......你都隨身帶著這種抑制藥物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"總有必要的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等......咳咳，醫、醫生......這個，很貴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"都什麼時候啦！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不貴，不用在意。現在當務之急是抑制你的急性礦石病反應，避免源石結晶粉塵的爆發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你不希望村裡的其他人因為你而受難，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"穩住呼吸，別緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......嘶......醫、醫生......我不想......變成感染......咳咳......感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......嗚......我......咳咳......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窒息，但我們沒有呼吸機......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡什麼都沒有，但不代表我們什麼都不該做。把噴霧拿來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生！醫生！求求你救救這個糟老頭子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在源石粉塵滲入他創口的那一瞬間，他註定會成為一名感染者，而我能做的只是盡力延續他的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳咳——呼，哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抑制劑還沒有生效嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮到患者年齡，抑制劑本身就有極大風險，保持耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼吸平穩些了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"病好了嗎？他的病好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是指急性症狀的話，也許是的。但如果是說礦石病的話，我們無能為力，誰都無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會......那如果糾察隊的老爺來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就，那就把我......把我供出去！我本來就沒幾年好活了......感染就感染吧......別讓那些讀過書的小夥子四處亂說就行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不！不會的，不會的，只要把你藏好，不會有人發現的，大家都會把你藏好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，謝謝您了，醫生，雖然這不是最好的結果，但我們......我們也沒有什麼東西可以報答您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是醫生的職責。成為感染者之後的道路......才是你們需要考慮的。很抱歉，環境不允許我做更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抑制劑起效了，但是傷口仍舊有感染，會導致他的血栓惡化......也許我們得手術切除......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的判斷是正確的，老先生，咬緊牙關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好......好......呃啊，唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，莉莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好久不見，凱爾希所長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，邊走邊說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......你並不願意在那場屠殺之後還這樣與我對話，但我打心底裡慶幸你還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在那之後，你一直躲藏在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的山丘上，可以眺望到切爾諾伯格的高樓。如果是我，不會選在一個離航道這麼近的地方藏身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是暫作停留而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你在那之後都做了些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望仇恨在你們之間繼續連綿流淌。特別是，這股仇恨不光會使人採取自毀般的行徑，更會招來那些兇手的直接報復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是在故意說給我聽的，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否認，莉莉婭。但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，您出門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的學生，不必緊張，她是來接我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原來是這樣......不過，說是來接您的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝在上呀......您還是要走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您要走了，請一定要告訴我們一聲呀！您治好了我們的女兒，至少，請讓我們為您送行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好，好，那我們就不打擾二位了，離開之前，請一定要告訴我，凱爾希醫生......請別忘了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很受這裡人的歡迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們表露出了足夠多的善意，我只是盡了醫生的本職而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實他們的生活才是烏薩斯大部分人的面貌。待在研究所裡久了，我們都忘了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使刻意靠近移動城市的航道，也並不能為他們帶來機遇與繁榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反，附庸權力的鄉紳土豪為糾察隊剝削貧民提供了更便利的土壤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他們連一位醫學院畢業的普通醫生都請不起，一場普通的流感就能殺死一位年輕的少女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的視野很廣闊，是啊，一直如此......你還會治療流感？我以為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我是個對著論文和資料指指點點的科學家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，你比我想的更接近一個醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我從一開始就是個醫生。只是醫治的對象和抗爭的病灶在不斷變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你的學生才會那麼信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......莉莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的女兒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我把她交給了我的朋友。她和這一切都毫無瓜葛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她還......那麼小，她還不會說話，她甚至還不會行走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就這麼拋棄了我的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你本可以不這麼做，如果你希望和路易莎隱姓埋名地生活下去的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該知道我的想法，凱爾希所長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想要阻止你。但如果你的女兒都做不到讓你停下腳步，也許我的話你也聽不進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。你挺清楚的呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年的冬天很冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬比洛夫的父親因為兒子的死發了瘋，他在他湖邊的閣樓裡圈養著羽獸，每天都幻想著自己和兒子打獵的時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亞的孩子，柳德米拉，她也還小，但她已經足以理解一部分無法挽回的事情，沒人知道她如今到底過得如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有羅曼諾維奇，他的家人們變賣了所有的財產，離開了那座城市。即使他的兄弟根本不相信什麼事故，但有人讓他們閉嘴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至於更多人，警察提供了一份事無巨細的事故報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那份“事故傷亡名單”裡，沒有任何人離開切爾諾伯格的研究所。一場實驗事故引發的連鎖反應，還有軍方提供的屍體身份鑑定報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但某種直覺告訴我......有人活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"直覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為在那之後，所有受害者家屬都或多或少受到了匿名的幫助——以及警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不覺得那個怯懦無能的鮑里斯侯爵，或是謝爾蓋那個叛徒會有什麼慈悲之心，所以，一定有其他知情者活了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可直到三年後的今天我才找到你，凱爾希所長，我才找到你，你藏得可真好，你甚至能騙過秘密警察的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在刑偵方面，他們過於依賴烏薩斯最新的技術，但這反而為我創造了機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然......你是個公認的天才，無與倫比的科研領袖，否則大家也不會對你心服口服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——請如實告訴我，莉莉婭，有多少人參與了你的計畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......六七個吧。也許更多，我們不敢公然團結在一起，會被抓住把柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括我在內。所有人都在那場“事故”中失去了一些無法挽回的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你從什麼時候開始謀劃這件事的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我得知第四集團軍的爪牙在那個研究所射出的第一枚弩箭，就罪惡地貫穿了我孩子父親的脖頸時，從那時開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並非有勇無謀。雖然因為身體原因，我和你們共事的時間很短，但是......我也做到了一些事情，比如——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你找到了萬尼亞大公的所在，那所建立在移動城市之外的松心山谷療養院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而這位第四集團軍前參謀，也極可能是石棺事件幕後推動人之一的烏薩斯大公，也許正處於他漫長的征戰生涯中守備最脆弱的時期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想進行一次刺殺，莉莉婭，但這次復仇依舊算得上“有勇無謀”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算是明白，為什麼丈夫他......阿斯特羅夫他會那麼欽佩你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但你要知道，莉莉婭，殺死一位年邁的大公根本沒有任何意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許從一開始，那個年邁到在演講時需要注射強心劑的萬尼亞就不是真正的兇手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，凱爾希，我知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可難道我把路易莎託付給他人的時候，就只是為了一個理性的結果，一次所謂的正義的審判嗎？你不會猜不到的，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"盲目的復仇只會使你短視。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，凱爾希，也許你不會明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路易莎甚至都沒學會說“爸爸”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在這裡待了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不值一提的時間，莉莉婭，你的臉色很差，你需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是如何找到我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是偶然......如果不是這個偶然，也許我根本發現不了你還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不願意孩子們受到太多傷害，起先，我們是打算找柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那時候，從柳德米拉的保姆那裡得知，有人在保持著對她們的聯絡和幫助。是個匿名角色，但她似乎對一切都瞭若指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是這個匿名者，甚至都為她準備好了離開烏薩斯的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我就確信，還有人活著。而據我所知，能辦成這件事的人，寥寥無幾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"喝杯茶吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會迫不及待地詢問我療養院的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉婭，我想迫不及待的人，其實是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這件事，原來你一直都知道萬尼亞身在何方......你就真的作壁上觀？你應該知道他掌握著什麼秘密！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的秘密已經在伊利亞的堅持下被永遠封存在了那個研究所。時至今日，軍隊也沒能從中得到半點他們垂涎的好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而萬尼亞大公身患頑疾，每年冬天都會在松心山谷療養。只要有辦法混入任何一次所謂上流社會的沙龍，就不難得到這個情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他甚至會四處誇耀那座療養院的美麗與寬廣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。那座療養院裡有不少戰功卓越的烏薩斯軍人，當然，也有官僚和貴族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"潛入那裡並暗殺一位大公，其荒唐程度並不亞於你在切爾諾伯格持刀闖入鮑里斯侯爵的宅邸，割開他的喉嚨再全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的沒錯。但對於“官僚和貴族”們而言，那裡的警戒依舊薄弱到讓人蠢蠢欲動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否認。可你怎麼知道那不是一個訊號，一個萬尼亞大公不再位高權重的訊號，又或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者萬尼亞大公已經被某些人安排好了命運？我說過，凱爾希，我要的不是一次公正的審判。說直白點，我渴求的是一場私刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是討論正義和道德的時候，凱爾希，只有高枕無憂的人才喜歡用“客觀”做擋箭牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬尼亞大公被軍方或者皇帝本人問責，變成替死鬼，或者在政鬥中站錯了隊，遭到流放，被集團軍雪藏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——無論怎樣，哪怕他最後慘死於絞刑架，那又與我何干呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他推動著切爾諾伯格的一切變得更糟，我只知道，他應該付出代價，“向我們”付出代價！他是殺了我孩子父親的兇手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經想好了混入療養院的方法......但我也得承認，即使那裡的警戒薄弱得可疑，也不代表我們中的任何人可以輕鬆得手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了一個突破口。一個在貴族療養院當了三十幾年安全負責人，卻忌憚貴族而不敢輕易撈取任何油水的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在......同僚們的幫助下準備了一大筆錢，那個一事無成的，眼看著就要退休的老傢伙一口就答應了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們花了很多力氣才讓他相信，我只是個鄉下暴發戶的女兒，為了傍上某位貴族或者將校才想進入療養院實習工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望我幫你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，無論何種形式的身份偽造都有風險，但我想，療養院總不至於和情報機構交流密切，那麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果就連秘密警察都誤以為你死了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那死亡將使你暢通無阻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希","莉莉婭"]}]}
